## 2. 当前主配置

主配置文件为：

```text
config/system.yaml
```

当前生产配置重点参数如下：

```yaml
app:
  input_source: "mvs:0"
  onnx_model_path: "models/best_opset12.onnx"
  class_names_path: "config/classes.txt"
  calibration_file: "../camera"

  focal_length_mm: 8.0
